### 6. Environment Security & Variables

All authentication layers must be managed strictly via secure platform configurations.
*   `AGENTROUTER_API_KEY`: Required token for downstream authentications.
*   `CORS_ALLOW_ORIGINS`: Configured to permit localized cross-origin requests during app synthesis.